# Only the built page and its PWA files belong here. Deny everything, allow by name.
# Tooling in the parent directory has written stray state into this checkout before,
# and a 1.5 MB database reached a public repo as a result.
*
!.gitignore
!index.html
!.nojekyll
!README.md
!manifest.webmanifest
!sw.js
!icon.svg
